OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 300 calls to police
OL,4,Aafter hoax bomb threats at schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people contacted police
OL,7,Fafter schools across Scotland were
OL,8,Ftargeted by hoax bomb threat emails.
OL,10,FSpecialist cyber crime officers have
OL,11,Fnow begun an investigation into the
OL,12,Fsource of the messages, which were sent
OL,13,Fto both primary and secondary schools.
OL,15,FThe warnings were quickly identified as
OL,16,Fhoaxes and learning was unaffected in
OL,17,Fschools where pupils had returned from
OL,18,Fthe October break, while other schools
OL,19,Fwere still on holiday.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
